<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against both the dollar and pound on Wednesday, commercial banks forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean commercial rate of 20.489 for one dollar from 20.404 on Tuesday. Against the pound, the rupee traded at a mean rate of 33.7920 from 33.6225 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
